WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.959
Checked the wrong person in? Reset clears today for them.

2
00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:27.502
Find the attendee whose record you want to clear.

3
00:00:27.502 --> 00:00:33.611
Tap their name to select it.

4
00:00:33.611 --> 00:00:40.640
Tap Reset, in the row under the two big buttons.

5
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.090
Resetting a record needs your instructor PIN.

6
00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:48.311
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

7
00:00:48.311 --> 00:00:54.344
Type your six digits.

8
00:00:54.344 --> 00:00:58.715
Then tap Unlock.

9
00:00:58.715 --> 00:01:05.158
The times it is about to clear are shown, so you can check them.

10
00:01:05.158 --> 00:01:15.367
Confirm. Only today is cleared — every other day is kept.
